{
  "name": "AI Support Inquiry Router",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "support-inquiry-demo",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "4ecf91f8-41aa-4b99-bf0b-a9041119649f",
      "name": "Support Inquiry Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        -592,
        128
      ],
      "webhookId": "f08b6c60-83e9-467b-a858-cb95b56022a9"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "cachedResultName": "GPT-4O-MINI",
          "cachedResultUrl": ""
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "You are a support inquiry classifier for a customer support team. Given a customer message, respond with ONLY a valid JSON object (no markdown, no commentary) with exactly these fields:\n- category: one of \"Billing\", \"Technical\", \"General Inquiry\"\n- sentiment: one of \"Frustrated\", \"Neutral\", \"Positive\"\n- priority: one of \"High\", \"Medium\", \"Low\"\n- summary: a 1-sentence summary of the inquiry\n- draft_response: a short, context-aware, empathetic draft reply to the customer",
              "role": "system"
            },
            {
              "content": "={{ $json.body.message ?? $json.body.data?.fields?.[0]?.value ?? '' }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simplify": "={{ true }}",
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9d7a965e-7331-4078-a521-4eaa8b04b97a",
      "name": "Classify Inquiry (OpenAI)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.8,
      "position": [
        -384,
        112
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "d4e5f6a7-cond-0001",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.message.content.priority }}",
                    "rightValue": "High",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "d4e5f6a7-cond-0002",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.message.content.sentiment }}",
                    "rightValue": "Frustrated",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "or"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Urgent"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "d4e5f6a7-cond-0003",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.message.content.priority }}",
                    "rightValue": "Medium",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "d4e5f6a7-cond-0004",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.message.content.priority }}",
                    "rightValue": "Low",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "or"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Standard"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "none"
        }
      },
      "id": "7d75b43d-56e8-4289-badc-c816cf9d7f1b",
      "name": "Priority Router",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        -64,
        128
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const data = $input.first().json;\nconst classification = data.message?.content ?? data;\nconst body = $('Support Inquiry Webhook').first().json.body ?? {};\nconst originalMessage = body.message ?? body.data?.fields?.[0]?.value ?? '';\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    alertType: \"URGENT\",\n    channel: \"#support-urgent\",\n    to: \"support-team@example.com\",\n    subject: `[URGENT] ${classification.category} inquiry - ${classification.priority} priority`,\n    message: `New urgent support request.\\n\\nCategory: ${classification.category}\\nSentiment: ${classification.sentiment}\\nSummary: ${classification.summary}\\n\\nSuggested response:\\n${classification.draft_response}`,\n    originalMessage,\n    notifiedAt: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "1e1be999-f996-447b-a9fc-198b233cf8a8",
      "name": "Prepare Urgent Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        192,
        -16
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const data = $input.first().json;\nconst classification = data.message?.content ?? data;\nconst body = $('Support Inquiry Webhook').first().json.body ?? {};\nconst originalMessage = body.message ?? body.data?.fields?.[0]?.value ?? '';\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    logType: \"STANDARD_AUTO_REPLY\",\n    category: classification.category,\n    sentiment: classification.sentiment,\n    priority: classification.priority,\n    summary: classification.summary,\n    draftResponse: classification.draft_response,\n    originalMessage,\n    loggedAt: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "609b686d-c548-4c46-8d5a-c2c46474a6d3",
      "name": "Prepare Standard Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        192,
        272
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Support Inquiry Router\n\n1. Webhook receives a customer message (`{\"message\": \"...\"}` or a Tally form)\n2. GPT-4o-mini returns category, sentiment, priority, a one-line summary and a draft reply\n3. High priority or frustrated customers go to the urgent branch, everything else to standard\n\nThe two end nodes prepare the alert / reply data. Connect a Slack, Gmail or helpdesk node to actually send it.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 480
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
